            "modified": "2026-04-27T18:13:24.886416Z",
            "name": "Qilin",
            "description": "The most active ransomware group in August 2026, responsible for 15% of attributable attacks. The group is known for its double-extortion tactics, where they encrypt and steal data, threatening to publish it on their data leak site. They target a wide range of industries, with a focus on the industrial and healthcare sectors.",
            "goals": [
                "Financial extortion through ransomware and data exfiltration."
            ],
            "sophistication": "advanced"
        },
